<view class="chrome-root" style="{{chromeStyle}}"><view class="topbar"><button class="topbar__back" bindtap="back" aria-label="返回"><image class="topbar__back-icon" src="/assets/icons/arrow-left-ink.svg" mode="aspectFit"/></button><text class="topbar__title">隐私与数据权利</text></view><view class="page page--stack rights-page"><view class="glass rights-card"><view class="rights-title">我们如何协助你</view><text>运营主体：熹芃（上海）生物科技有限公司</text><text>你可以申请查阅、复制、更正、删除个人信息，或注销账号、撤回同意。提交后请在本页查看回复。为保护账号安全，处理前可能需要核验身份；申请不等于已执行删除或注销。</text><text>请勿填写密码、身份证号或无关敏感信息。</text></view><block wx:if="{{authenticated}}"><view class="glass rights-card"><picker range="{{labels}}" value="{{selected}}" bindchange="choose" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="rights-picker">请求类型：{{labels[selected]}} ▾</view></picker><textarea class="rights-input" value="{{message}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="2000" disabled="{{busy}}" placeholder="请说明你希望处理的数据或遇到的问题" aria-label="请求说明"/><button class="primary {{busy ? 'primary--disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">提交请求</button></view><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="state">{{notice}}</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="state state--error">{{error}}</view><view class="rights-title">受理记录</view><button class="text-button {{loading ? 'text-button--disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="load" disabled="{{loading}}">{{loading ? '正在加载…' : '刷新记录'}}</button><view wx:if="{{!loading && !records.length}}" class="state">暂无受理记录</view><view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id" class="glass rights-card"><view class="rights-title">{{item.label}} · {{item.statusLabel}}</view><text>{{item.message}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.response}}">回复：{{item.response}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.executionSummary}}">执行状态：{{item.executionSummary}}</text><text class="rights-meta" user-select="true">编号 {{item.id}}</text></view></block><block wx:else><view class="state">登录后可提交与你的会员账号关联的请求，并查看处理记录。未登录也可使用微信反馈渠道联系我们。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="login">登录并提交账号请求</button></block><button class="secondary" open-type="feedback">通过微信反馈联系运营方</button><text class="rights-meta">也可从右上角“…”进入“反馈与投诉”。微信反馈由微信平台按其规则受理和转达。</text></view></view>
